    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have you ever dreamed of crafting beautiful floral arrangements that brighten someone's day?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Flowers and Favours</strong> is a cozy and relaxing florist sim where you can craft beautiful bouquets, experiment with different blooms, and run your very own flower shop. This is your space to create and unwind.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269600/extras/db511c91bd59de67ba0378845cca1b8b.poster.avif?t=1755112115\" width=800 height=372 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269600/extras/db511c91bd59de67ba0378845cca1b8b.webm?t=1755112115\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269600/extras/db511c91bd59de67ba0378845cca1b8b.mp4?t=1755112115\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Listen and Learn</strong> - Chat with adorable customers to understand their unique stories and needs for the perfect bouquet</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269600/extras/f67dba014d0e2e5b7470591675eb4507.poster.avif?t=1755112115\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269600/extras/f67dba014d0e2e5b7470591675eb4507.webm?t=1755112115\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269600/extras/f67dba014d0e2e5b7470591675eb4507.mp4?t=1755112115\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unleash Your Creativity</strong> - Create one-of-a-kind bouquets using intuitive and flexible design tools\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269600/extras/6045c43055e8a81b066e5aa11fd91d66.poster.avif?t=1755112115\" width=798 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269600/extras/6045c43055e8a81b066e5aa11fd91d66.webm?t=1755112115\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269600/extras/6045c43055e8a81b066e5aa11fd91d66.mp4?t=1755112115\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Complete Your Masterpiece With the Perfect Wrap</strong> - Select from elegant wrapping options, ribbons, and finishing touches to make each bouquet truly special</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have you ever dreamed of crafting beautiful floral arrangements that brighten someone's day?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Flowers and Favours</strong> is a cozy and relaxing florist sim where you can craft beautiful bouquets, experiment with different blooms, and run your very own flower shop. This is your space to create and unwind.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269600/extras/db511c91bd59de67ba0378845cca1b8b.poster.avif?t=1755112115\" width=800 height=372 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269600/extras/db511c91bd59de67ba0378845cca1b8b.webm?t=1755112115\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269600/extras/db511c91bd59de67ba0378845cca1b8b.mp4?t=1755112115\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Listen and Learn</strong> - Chat with adorable customers to understand their unique stories and needs for the perfect bouquet</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269600/extras/f67dba014d0e2e5b7470591675eb4507.poster.avif?t=1755112115\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269600/extras/f67dba014d0e2e5b7470591675eb4507.webm?t=1755112115\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269600/extras/f67dba014d0e2e5b7470591675eb4507.mp4?t=1755112115\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unleash Your Creativity</strong> - Create one-of-a-kind bouquets using intuitive and flexible design tools\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269600/extras/6045c43055e8a81b066e5aa11fd91d66.poster.avif?t=1755112115\" width=798 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269600/extras/6045c43055e8a81b066e5aa11fd91d66.webm?t=1755112115\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3269600/extras/6045c43055e8a81b066e5aa11fd91d66.mp4?t=1755112115\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Complete Your Masterpiece With the Perfect Wrap</strong> - Select from elegant wrapping options, ribbons, and finishing touches to make each bouquet truly special</p>",
